---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure class="handoff series-visual not-prose">
  <div class="current stage">
    <div class="stage-title">
      <strong>当前：工具刚执行完</strong><span>结果还没有写入历史</span>
    </div>
    <div class="current-state">
      <div class="history-before card">
        <strong>history 里已有</strong>
        <ol>
          <li>用户任务：读取 README，说明启动方式</li>
          <li>模型回复：请求读取 README.md</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-output card">
        <strong>工具刚返回</strong>
        <p>启动命令：npm run dev</p>
        <small>这是本地工具读取到的内容。</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="connection">
    <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> Agent 循环把工具结果追加到 history
  </div>
  <div class="history-after stage">
    <div class="stage-title">
      <strong>更新后的 history</strong><span>仍是 Agent 内部的消息格式</span>
    </div>
    <ol class="messages">
      <li class="existing">
        <span class="number">1</span><div>
          <strong>用户任务</strong><span
            >读取 README，告诉我项目怎样启动。</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="request">
        <span class="number">2</span><div>
          <strong>模型的工具请求</strong><span
            >要求读取 README.md，已在执行工具前写入。</span>
        </div><small>新增消息</small>
      </li>
      <li class="result">
        <span class="number">3</span><div>
          <strong>工具结果</strong><span>启动命令：npm run dev</span>
        </div><small>刚刚追加</small>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="connection">
    <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> 把更新后的历史交给模型接入层
  </div>
  <div class="next stage">
    <div class="stage-title">
      <strong>接下来：怎样放进模型服务的请求？</strong>
    </div>
    <p>用户消息的转换已在 2.1 讲过。现在需要处理新增的两条消息：</p>
    <ul>
      <li>模型提出的<strong>工具请求</strong>，在 API 中怎样表示？</li>
      <li>本地返回的<strong>工具结果</strong>，该放在请求的什么位置？</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="destination">
      <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><strong>构造模型服务接收的请求</strong
      ><span>让模型同时看到任务、工具请求和读取结果。</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    “新增”指相对第一次模型调用，多出的工具请求和工具结果。下面继续看模型接入层怎样转换这两条消息。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .handoff {
    container-type: inline-size;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .stage {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-secondary);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--series-canvas);
  }
  .stage-title {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .stage-title strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .stage-title span {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .current-state {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .card {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .card strong {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .card p {
    margin: 0.4rem 0;
  }
  .card small {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .history-before ol {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .history-before li + li {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
  .tool-output {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .tool-output > strong {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .connection {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .connection > span {
    color: var(--series-blue);
    margin-right: 0.3rem;
  }
  .handoff .messages {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .messages li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    background: var(--series-paper);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
  }
  .messages li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .messages .number {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .messages li > div {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .messages strong,
  .messages li > div > span {
    display: block;
  }
  .messages li > div > span {
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .messages small {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .messages .existing {
    background: transparent;
    border-style: dashed;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .messages .existing strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .messages .request {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .request small {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .messages .result {
    border-color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .result small {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  .next {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .next .stage-title {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .next p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .next ul {
    margin: 0.6rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
  .next li + li {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
  .destination {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--series-blue);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .destination > span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .handoff figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  @container (max-width: 480px) {
    .stage {
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }
    .current-state {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .messages li {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    }
    .messages li > div {
      flex-basis: calc(100% - 1.5rem);
    }
    .messages small {
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
